  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\" data-listener-added_ed44aecb=\"true\" data-listener-added_15ecd590=\"true\" data-listener-added_cf5f9ad6=\"true\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-embPQ3YK\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uYS5THdV\">使用SPI服务，需要提供一个回调地址，用于接收订阅推送的消息内容</p></blockquote><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-PUKGVYAT\" id=\"link-0\">支持的通信协议</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-kTab7pik\"><strong>HTTP/HTTPS 协议</strong></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-6flSMH5d\" id=\"link-1\">请求方式</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-RnlSFT5V\"><strong>GET/POST</strong>&nbsp;回调地址需要同时支持GET和POST请求</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-V2TE37Jf\" id=\"link-2\">Challenge 验证</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-P0uvgj01\">创建订阅任务填写回调地址时，系统会发送challenge挑战，验证URL的归属，请求参数如下</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-HV9kl5XN\" id=\"link-3\">请求参数</h2><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-blYaOMIX\" class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-4UKD5NFC\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-hNW22TTU\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-f5VF34gH\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-IjDJTmTn\" span=\"1\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-JlG63YS5\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-K4Tdul9U\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-B9eYi81C\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4Z386XOi\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-li84aY7X\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xfNPhoLf\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-d35MXIeS\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Gjv44B76\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-4P2Mpgwd\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-BCJgIfqY\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kUQBDT9m\">challenge</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-vQVsBOPn\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-G6OqGCMA\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-La10ATSD\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-elbo1HqE\">随机数</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-XO1h69uQ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-DRG8W8l6\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YQvyKKIl\">event</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-4kLCSDJo\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-j6wr3hgQ\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tb871063-MP5l6E43\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NNXQgXG4\">事件值，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">verify_webhook</code>为Challenge验证事件</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-7F5LGfXr\" id=\"link-4\">应答参数</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-TdYsDDRM\">在收到Challeng请求后，需要按照下述格式返回应答，要求response 的&nbsp;<strong>Content-Type 为 application/json</strong></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t615773a-KlQ0gGVa\" class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-fD3lSWcT\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-TBeCV1Vi\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-Y59a8Z15\" span=\"1\"><col width=\"33.33333333333333%\" data-id=\"cd11d5e0-Ha4KkRQR\" span=\"1\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-3Ik0ZgH1\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-dlZXpDM7\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-o0Y0hGT2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-J67sGHDz\">字段</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-cVU8Ka5J\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PHxdkd19\">类型</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-IQaGQHiB\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ubjzhMql\">描述</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-CH0g5rsp\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-IEBaydWG\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-6K1jRCJd\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"></span>BaseResp</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-KZmg88As\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iJIrbA2Q\">object</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-UnDE59P4\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9ng7aIJ3\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-u8fd3yKa\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-FtA7lgxE\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2psSnc5L\"><span data-level=\"1\" class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22V2Sh6%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\">&nbsp;</span>StatusCode</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-l2TOk7tW\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Wy2XgIO7\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-XMPUckXM\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AAB1KguB\">执行状态码，200表示成功，4xx 业务异常不重试，5xx 系统异常重试</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-jpy29d1W\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-xMcP5G00\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XPoeGqOa\"><span data-level=\"1\" class=\"qz-table-level qz-table-level-1\" data-type=\"level\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22level%22%3A1%2C%22id%22%3A%22U09MG%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22inline%22%7D\">&nbsp;</span>StatusMessage</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-2KURqnvZ\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YvAttkzU\">string</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"td0a4e23-OFd3VCTA\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kXvRtQ7L\">执行结果</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-SqLIx9df\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-61pXZ5YD\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Oxsji3NF\">challenge</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t498e912-NAYJVdK8\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FLO1aP5h\">number</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"tb871063-beNdSVNT\" colspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZEgj82fY\">回传请求中的challenge值</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-6LGWep64\" id=\"link-5\">应答示例</h2><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22BaseResp%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22StatusCode%5C%22%3A%20200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22StatusMessage%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22ok%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22challenge%5C%22%3A%201%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22w1abm%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-cSItK6mx\"><br></p></div>",
